PATCH 617: count the original KDV decoder instructions by branch and write predicates (board:0034).

The assembly at 7135..746a has five cell paths. The fixed setup/row/header work,
per-path costs and conditional stores in this patch reproduce all 395 TITLE.KDV
Oracle IP histograms (tools/oracle/check_kdv_instruction_formula.py). This hook
records the decoder's work without yet charging the virtual clock; file-read
cycle caps, page faults and interleaved ISRs still require separate timing models.
